        "paragraph_3": "But I quickly noticed a bigger problem.",
        "paragraph_4": "Guys were buying our protein, using it for a few weeks, and quitting because they didn't see results.",
        "quote_1": "<span class=\"bold\">They weren't failing because of the product.</span><br><span class=\"accent bold\">They were failing because of the strategy.</span>",
        "paragraph_5": "They were following influencers/trainers with a different body type and genetics from them and hoping it works for them.",
        "highlight_text": "I realized selling supplements without coaching is like selling running shoes without teaching someone how to run.",
        "paragraph_6": "That's why this program exists. We combined our local products (like our Whey and Protein Yogurt) with the missing piece: <span class=\"accent bold\">Guidance.</span>",
        "statement": "I don't just want to sell you powder. I want to sell you the <span class=\"accent\">result.</span> That's why if you don't hit your goals, I lose money.",
        "signature": "— Collins"
      }
